# Custom Plan post-completion card-stat rows

Add five resource-stat rows after any ordered construction-step rows in every expanded custom plan.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Every expanded custom plan shows exactly five post-completion card-stat rows.
- [ ] Rows appear in Brick, Wood, Hay, Sheep, Ore order and use the shared resource icons without redundant names.
- [ ] A clearly associated fixed-pane label identifies the group as `Card stats after plan completion`.
- [ ] For Construction plans, the complete ordered Steps section appears before the card-stat section.
- [ ] Cards-only plans omit Steps and begin directly with card-stat rows.
- [ ] Each resource row uses the same summary and probability columns as plan/step rows.
- [ ] Fixed resource rows and scrolling values remain vertically aligned while expanding, collapsing, scrolling, and switching table sections.
- [ ] Placeholder card statistics are deterministic, player-aware, hand-aware where applicable, and red until simulation output exists.
- [ ] Ownership dots and All-player filtering from TASK-027 remain correct for expanded plans.
- [ ] Stable row identities prevent animation collisions between resources or different plans.
- [ ] Domain row-model and UI regression coverage compile.
- [ ] Focused animation/alignment checks pass on a functioning simulator.

## Scope notes

- This task consumes TASK-029's expandable hierarchy and must not create a second independent expansion implementation.
